00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
This might actually be the most life-changing accessibility app ever created.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,800
If you struggle with dyslexia, words literally scramble across the screen and make reading agonizingly slow.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:19,500
VoiceReader uses dual modality sensory learning, highlighting every word in bright dynamic color while reading aloud with studio quality AI voices, completely eliminating reading fatigue for good.

